# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Patient data. Nothing recorded from a patient belongs in this repository.
# Waveform exports are identifiable health information, the .inf sidecar carries
# the patient's name in cleartext, and the case-log document carries name, MRN
# and date of birth in its first few lines.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data/
**/derived/
*.bin
*.inf
*.csv
*.docx
*.odt
# ...except the synthetic sample, generated by scripts/make_sample{,_log}.py
!sample/SYNTH01.bin
!sample/SYNTH01.inf
!sample/SYNTH01.docx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local tooling
